{"name": "Eventide Matter", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/67e813a353cb1126bf0c38ffd8211a6b.poster.avif?t=1782930105\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/67e813a353cb1126bf0c38ffd8211a6b.webm?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/67e813a353cb1126bf0c38ffd8211a6b.mp4?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Vanguard Unit 4, the last hope of a dying universe. Your mission: build a Phase Gate in an uncharted continuum to evacuate the fleeing remnants of your civilization before reality itself collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this new dimension is not empty. It is defended by crystalline lifeforms that see you as an invader. They will stop at nothing to destroy your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The clock is ticking. With every passing moment, your home universe decays. The fleet is counting on you. Will you hold the line and open the path to salvation?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Eventide Matter features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/a67864bb81af740e742dfbdc29596a14.poster.avif?t=1782930105\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/a67864bb81af740e742dfbdc29596a14.webm?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/a67864bb81af740e742dfbdc29596a14.mp4?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine 6 unique materials and craft them into advanced components.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.poster.avif?t=1782930105\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.webm?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.mp4?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research dozens of permanent upgrades in a sprawling tech tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.poster.avif?t=1782930105\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.webm?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.mp4?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and enhance around 10 module types, including lasers, thrusters, tractor beams, drones, and shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4a1c31dbb5d2d3e7447c9f10005ed3b9.poster.avif?t=1782930105\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4a1c31dbb5d2d3e7447c9f10005ed3b9.webm?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4a1c31dbb5d2d3e7447c9f10005ed3b9.mp4?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble the complex portal piece by piece, through multiple intricate layers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/f5e6c6c90ee3f21ebba69c7619d6ba50.poster.avif?t=1782930105\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/f5e6c6c90ee3f21ebba69c7619d6ba50.webm?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/f5e6c6c90ee3f21ebba69c7619d6ba50.mp4?t=1782930105\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive relentless enemies that pursue you and seek to destroy your progress.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "A 2D space mining adventure. Mine exotic resources, unlock powerful equipment, and fend off relentless enemies to build an inter-dimensional portal, the last hope of salvation for your civilization.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea